  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Basic Education Quality and Access in Lao PDR program Phase 2 (BEQUAL Phase 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Basic Education Quality and Access in Laos (BEQUAL) Program Phase 2 aims to improve primary student learning outcomes by focusing on teaching quality. BEQUAL Phase 2 strengthens the education system by advancing key national policy reforms in teaching practices, content and continuing professional development. It promotes inclusive education to address issues of inequality and inequity throughout its activities.</narrative>
  </description>
